Justin Hiltscher wrote:

> What's the flag that causes the critter to try to steal the Amulet and 
> Invocation Items, etc?  Covetous doesn't cause the monster to go after 
> the holder of the Amulet?

It has been a while, but as far as I remember a monster is covetous
(is_covetous) if at least one of the flags for wanting the Amulet, Bell,
Book, Candelabrum or Quest-Artifact is set.

There are also M3_WANTSALL and M3_COVETOUS. Both mean that the monster 
wants all the items.

It's a bit confusing, but to be "is_covetous" the monster doesn't need
the whole M3_COVETOUS.

Covetous monsters that don't want the Amulet seem to be:
   Master/Arch-Lich -> Want the Book
   Quest-Nemesis    -> Want the Quest-Artifact

